ind":"announcement","title":"Dear Nobody demo: recorded gameplay","summary":"A recorded run through the free Dear Nobody demo plays here on some evenings (18:00–24:00 CET/CEST) during Steam Next Fest: letters read and answered. It is not live, so a question in chat may wait a while. The demo is free on this page.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:13:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690166","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4957320-1846651706686500","game_id":"steam-4957320","kind":"announcement","title":"The desk is open: the first three chapters are free","summary":"The desk is open The first three chapters of Dear Nobody are free on Steam, starting today. Our last post said the desk would open on 8 October. We held it back so it would open with Steam Next Fest, when the most people are looking — so it opens today instead, and the festival runs until 26 October. You are a censor in a nameless war. Two people who have never met write to each other, and their letters cross your desk before they reach the other one. Your instructions are written down and they ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:16:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686500","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4957320-1842846814452478","game_id":"steam-4957320","kind":"announcement","title":"The desk opens on 8 October","summary":"The demo has a date On 8 October, the first three chapters of Dear Nobody become free. You are a censor in a nameless war. Two people who have never met write to each other, and every letter crosses your desk before it reaches the other one. Your instructions 